n.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5a/Generic_Necrotic_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Generic_Necrotic_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5a/Generic_Necrotic_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Generic_Necrotic_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Cursed Vengeance\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5a/Generic_Necrotic_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Necrotic_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5a/Generic_Necrotic_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Cursed_Vengeance_(Condition)\" title=\"Cursed Vengeance (Condition)\"><b>Cursed Vengeance</b></a></span></p></div><div class=\"bg3wiki-pi-creature-detail-text\"><ul><li>Any damage done against Oliver will be reflected twofold at the attacker.</li></ul></div></div></li></ul></div>\n</div></section><section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\"><h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Features</h2><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"t passives\" data-item-name=\"passives\">\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><ul><li><div class=\"bg3wiki-pi-creature-detail\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-pi-creature-detail-title\"><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Cursed_Vengeance\" title=\"Cursed Vengeance\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a9/Generic_Feature_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Feature_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a9/Generic_Feature_Icon.webp/38px-Generic_Feature_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a9/Generic_Feature_Icon.webp/50px-Generic_Feature_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Cursed Vengeance\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a9/Generic_Feature_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Feature_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a9/Generic_Feature_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Cursed_Vengeance\" title=\"Cursed Vengeance\"><b>Cursed Vengeance</b></a></span></p></div><div class=\"bg3wiki-pi-creature-detail-text\"><p>Oliver's Nightdome won't allow for you to hurt him. Any damage done to the dome will be reflected in twofold to its attacker.</p></div></div></li></ul></div>\n</div></section></section>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n</section></aside>\n<b>Nightdome</b> is an <a href=\"/wiki/Environmental_object\" title=\"Environmental object\">environmental object</a> found in <a href=\"/wiki/Act_Two\" title=\"Act Two\">Act Two</a>. \n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Involvement\">Involvement</span></h2>\n<p>It is a magical shield born of the <a href=\"/wiki/Shadow_curse\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Shadow curse\">shadow curse</a>. The Nightdome acts as a shield to protect <a href=\"/wiki/Oliver\" title=\"Oliver\">Oliver</a> during his combat encounter. \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Mechanics\">Mechanics</span></h2>\n<p>The shield is resistant to all damage types other than magical weapons and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Force\" title=\"Force\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Force_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Force_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Force_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Force\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Force_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Force\" title=\"Force\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-force\">Force</span></a>.\n</p><p>However, damaging the shield directly is a risky prospect on <a href=\"/wiki/Tactician\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Tactician\">Tactician</a> difficulty, as it triggers its condition <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Cursed_Vengeance_(Condition)\" title=\"Cursed Vengeance (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5a/Generic_Necrotic_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Necrotic_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5a/Generic_Necrotic_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Generic_Necrotic_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5a/Generic_Necrotic_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Generic_Necrotic_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Cursed Vengeance\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5a/Generic_Necrotic_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Necrotic_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5a/Generic_Necrotic_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Cursed_Vengeance_(Condition)\" title=\"Cursed Vengeance (Condition)\">Cursed Vengeance</a> to return all damage dealt back to the attacker twofold. All reflected damage is dealt as <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Necrotic\" title=\"Necrotic\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Necrotic\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Necrotic\" title=\"Necrotic\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-necrotic\">Necrotic</span></a> damage.\n</p><p>Alternatively, the Nightdome loses chunks of HP as flat force damage whenever one of Oliver's allied shadows is destroyed. Destroying his allies and summons eventually destroys the Nightdome on its own.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Health_reductions\">Health reductions</span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Mummy_(wraith)\" title=\"Mummy (wraith)\">Mummy</a>: <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-force\">60</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Force\" title=\"Force\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Force_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Force_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Force_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Force\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Force_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Force\" title=\"Force\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-force\">Force</span></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Daddy\" title=\"Daddy\">Daddy</a>: <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-force\">60</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Force\" title=\"Force\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Force_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Force_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Force_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Force\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Force_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Force\" title=\"Force\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-force\">Force</span></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Shadow_Plush\" title=\"Shadow Plush\">Shadow Plush</a>: <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-force\">60</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Force\" title=\"Force\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Force_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Force_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Force_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Force\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Force_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Force\" title=\"Force\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-force\">Force</span></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Shadow_Friend\" title=\"Shadow Friend\">Shadow Friend</a>: <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-force\">10</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Force\" title=\"Force\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Force_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Force_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d1/Force_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Force_Damage_Icon.png.web